<p className="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">For questions about immigration requirements, start with official documents, not comments on social media. The U.S. government maintains pages for visitor-visa categories, the DS-160, document requirements, visa denials, nationality-specific issuance schedules and appointment wait times. The Moroccan Embassy in the United States also provides a useful explanation of the application sequence for Moroccan residents.</p>
