<p className="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">Before submitting, check that your passport information is accurate, your DS-160 answers are true, your application fee is paid through the approved method and your interview date is confirmed. For ordinary travel inspiration in Morocco, you can separately explore <Link href="/all-morocco-tours-packages/" className="font-bold text-amber-700 underline decoration-amber-300 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-amber-800">our complete Morocco tour packages</Link> or a <Link href="/one-week-in-morocco-itinerary/" className="font-bold text-amber-700 underline decoration-amber-300 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-amber-800">seven-day Morocco itinerary</Link>. Carry the requested documents, keep your trip realistic and do not rely on anyone promising an approval. Once the visa is granted, read the entry and stay conditions carefully before traveling.</p>
